{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-isa-57-1","title":"Isaiah 57:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The blessed death of the righteous. 3 God reproves the Jews for their whorish idolatry. 13 He gives promises of mercy to the penitent.</p>\n<p>righteous. 2Ch 32:33; 35:24 no man. 11; 42:25; 47:7; Mal 2:2 merciful men. Heb. men of kindness, or godliness. Ps 12:1; Mic 7:2 the righteous. 1Ki 14:13; 2Ki 22:20; 2Ch 34:28 the evil to come. or, that which is evil.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-2","title":"Isaiah 57:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>He shall. Job 3:17; Ec 12:7; Mt 25:21; Lu 16:22; 2Co 5:1,8; Php 1:23 Re 14:13 enter into. or, go in. Lu 2:29; 7:50 rest. 14:18; 2Ch 16:14; Eze 32:25 in his uprightness. or before him. Ge 17:1; Lu 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-3","title":"Isaiah 57:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>draw. 45:20; Joe 3:9-11 sons. Ge 3:15; Ho 1:2; Mt 3:7; 12:34; 16:4; 23:33; Lu 3:7; Joh 8:40-44 Jas 4:4; 1Jo 3:10; Re 17:1-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-4","title":"Isaiah 57:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Against. 10:15; 37:23,29; Ex 9:17; 16:7,8; Nu 16:11; Lu 10:16; Ac 9:4 sport. Jud 16:25-27; Ps 69:12; Mt 27:29,39-44; 2Pe 2:13 make. Ps 35:21 draw. Jos 10:21; Job 16:9,10; Ps 22:7,13,17; La 2:15,16 are ye. 1:4; 30:1,9; Eze 2:4; Ho 10:9; Mt 13:38; Eph 2:2,3; 5:6; Col 3:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-5","title":"Isaiah 57:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Inflaming. Ex 32:6; Nu 25:1,2,6; Jer 50:38; 51:7; Ho 4:11-13; 7:4-7; Am 2:7,8 Re 17:1-5; 18:3 with idols. or, among the oaks. 1:29 under. De 12:2; 1Ki 14:23; 2Ki 16:3,4; 17:10; Jer 2:20; 3:6,13; 17:2 Eze 6:13 slaying. Le 18:21; 20:2-5; 2Ki 16:3; 23:10; 2Ch 28:3; Jer 7:31; 32:35 Eze 16:20; 20:26,31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-6","title":"Isaiah 57:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the smooth. Jer 3:9; Hab 2:19 to them. 65:11; De 32:37,38; Jer 7:18; 19:13; 32:29; 44:17-25 Should. 66:3; Eze 20:39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-7","title":"Isaiah 57:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Jer 2:20; 3:2; Eze 16:16,25; 20:28,29; 23:17,41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-8","title":"Isaiah 57:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>the doors. Eze 8:8-12; 23:14,41 for. Eze 16:32 made thee a covenant with them. or, hewed it for thyselflarger than theirs. thou lovedst. Eze 16:25-28; 23:2-20 where thou sawest it. or, thou providest room.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-9","title":"Isaiah 57:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>thou wentest to the king. or, thou respectedst the king. 30:1-6; 31:1-3; 2Ki 16:7-11; Eze 16:33; 23:16; Ho 7:11; 12:1 perfumes. Pr 7:17 and didst debase. 2:9; Col 2:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-10","title":"Isaiah 57:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>wearied. 47:13; Jer 2:36; 9:5; Eze 24:12; Hab 2:13 There is. 2Ch 28:22,23; Jer 2:25; 44:17,18; Ro 7:9 life. or, living. therefore. Jer 3:3; 5:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-11","title":"Isaiah 57:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>of whom. 51:12,13; Pr 29:25; Mt 26:69-75; Ga 2:12,13 that thou. 30:9; 59:3,4; Jer 9:3-5; 42:20; Eze 13:22; Ho 11:12; Ac 5:3; 2Th 2:9 1Ti 4:2; Re 21:8; 22:15 and hast. Jer 2:32; 3:21 nor. 1 have not. 26:10; Ps 50:21; Ec 8:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-12","title":"Isaiah 57:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>1:11-15; 58:2-6; 59:6-8; 64:5; 66:3,4; Jer 7:4-11; Mic 3:2-4 Mt 23:5,14; Ro 3:10-20; 10:2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-13","title":"Isaiah 57:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>let. 9,10; Jud 10:14; 2Ki 3:13; Jer 22:22; Zec 7:13 but the. 40:24; 41:16; Job 21:18; Ps 1:4; 58:9; Ho 13:3 but he. 26:3,4; Ps 37:3,9; 84:12; 125:1; Pr 28:25; Jer 17:7,8 my holy. 11:9; 56:7; 65:25; 66:20; Eze 20:40; Joe 3:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-14","title":"Isaiah 57:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Cast. 35:8; 40:3; 62:10; Lu 3:5,6 take. Ro 14:13; 1Co 1:23; 8:9,13; 10:32,33; 2Co 6:3; Heb 12:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-15","title":"Isaiah 57:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>the high. 6:1; Ps 83:18; 97:9; 138:6; Da 4:17,24,25,34 that inhabiteth. 40:28; Ge 21:33; De 33:27; Ps 90:2; 93:2; Pr 8:23; Jer 10:10 Mic 5:2; Ro 1:20; 1Ti 1:17; Heb 9:14 whose. 6:3; Ex 15:11; 1Sa 2:2; Job 6:10; Ps 99:3; 111:9; Lu 1:49; Ac 3:14 Re 3:7; 4:8; 15:4 I dwell. 66:1; 1Ki 8:27; Ps 68:4,5; 113:4-6; 115:3; 123:1; Zec 2:13; Mt 6:9 1Ti 6:16 with. 66:1,2; 2Ch 33:12,13; 34:27; Ps 34:18; 51:17; 138:6; Eze 9:4; 16:63 Mt 5:3,4; Jas 4:6; 1Pe 5:5 to revive the spirit. 61:1-3; Ps 147:3; Mt 5:4; Lu 4:18; 15:20-24; 2Co 1:4; 2:7; 7:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-16","title":"Isaiah 57:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>I will not. Ps 78:38,39; 85:5; 103:9-16; Jer 10:24; Mic 7:18 the souls. 42:5; Nu 16:22; Job 34:14,15; Ec 12:7; Jer 38:16; Zec 12:1 Heb 12:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-17","title":"Isaiah 57:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>the iniquity. 5:8,9; 56:11; Jer 6:13; 8:10; 22:17; Eze 33:31; Mic 2:2,3; Lu 12:15 Eph 5:3-5; Col 3:5; 1Ti 6:9; 2Pe 2:3,14 I hid. 8:17; 45:15 and he. 9:13; Jer 2:30; 5:3; Lu 15:14-16 frowardly. Heb. turning away. in the. Ec 6:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-18","title":"Isaiah 57:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>have. 1:18; 43:24,25; 48:8-11; Jer 31:18-20; Eze 16:60-63; 36:22-38 Lu 15:20; Ro 5:20 will heal. Jer 3:22; 31:3; 33:6; Ho 14:4-8 will lead. 49:10; Ps 23:2; Re 7:17 restore. 15; 12:1; 61:2,3; 66:10-13; Ps 51:12 to his. Jer 13:17; Ec 9:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-19","title":"Isaiah 57:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>I create.\"The sacrifice of praise,\" says St. Paul, \"is the fruit of the lips.\" God creates this fruit of the lips, by giving new subject and cause of thanksgiving by His mercies conferred on His people. The great subject of thanksgiving is peace, reconciliation and pardon offered to them that are nigh, and to them that are afar off; not only to the Jew, but also to the Gentile.</p>\n<p>the fruit. Ex 4:11,12; Ho 14:2; Lu 21:15; Eph 6:19; Col 4:3,4; Heb 13:15 Peace. Mt 10:13; Mr 16:15; Lu 2:14; 10:5,6; Ac 2:39; 10:36; 2Co 5:20,21 Eph 2:14-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-20","title":"Isaiah 57:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>like. 3:11; Job 15:20-24; 18:5-14; 20:11-29; Ps 73:18-20; Pr 4:16,17 Jude 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-isa-57-21","title":"Isaiah 57:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ISA","chapterStart":57,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":57,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>3:11; 48:22; 2Ki 9:22; Ro 3:16,17</p>"}]}